  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "３０００どの　ほのおを　あやつる。いわや　じゃりを　とかして　つくったマグマのうみを　ゆうゆうと　およぐ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "3000도의 불꽃을 조종한다. 바위와 자갈을 녹여서 만든 마그마의 바다를 유유히 헤엄친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能操控３０００度的火焰。會熔化岩石和沙礫做成熔岩海，並在裡面悠閒自在地游泳。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon manipule des flammes à 3 000 °C. Il nage tranquillement dans une mer de magma qu’il a créée en faisant fondre de la roche et du gravier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kontrolliert Flammen von 3000 ℃. Mühelos schwimmt es durch das Meer aus Lava, das es durch Schmelzen von Gestein und Kies erzeugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a su voluntad llamas de hasta 3000 ºC. Nada tranquilamente por los mares de magma que crea al derretir las rocas y la grava a su paso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Riesce a manipolare fiamme di 3.000 ºC. Nuota tranquillamente nei mari di magma che crea fondendo ghiaia e massi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It controls flames burning at over 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit. It casually swims through the sea of lava it creates by melting rock and sand.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "３０００度の　炎を　操る。岩や　砂利を　溶かして　作ったマグマの海を　ゆうゆうと　泳ぐ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会操控３０００度的火焰。熔化岩石和沙砾来做成熔岩海，并在里边悠闲自在地游泳。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Controla a su voluntad llamas de hasta 3000 ºC. Nada tranquilamente por los mares de magma que crea al derretir las rocas y la grava a su paso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおくの　あらそいの　ひだねとなったマガタマに　あつまった　ねたみがほのおを　まとい　ポケモンとなった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "여러 분쟁의 불씨가 된 곡옥에 모여든 질투가 불꽃을 두르고 포켓몬이 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "曾引起無數鬥爭的勾玉聚集了嫉妒之情。這些嫉妒之情纏繞了火焰，變成了寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La convoitise intense qu’attisaient des magatama à l’origine de nombreux conflits s’est mêlée à des flammes et a pris vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Neid, der sich in Krummjuwelen sammelte, die viel Streit heraufbeschworen, hüllte sich in Feuer und wurde zu diesem Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació al imbuirse en llamas la envidia acumulada en ciertos abalorios que desencadenaron un gran número de conflictos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prese vita quando il livore accumulatosi nei gioielli ricurvi che causarono svariati conflitti si ammantò di fiamme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The envy accumulated within curved beads that sparked multiple conflicts has clad itself in fire and become a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
